    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d348">

                <pb facs="0373" n="313" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg313"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Eustis</hi>.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d348-f1"/></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-02-04"><hi rendition="#italic">February 4,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You are authorized to effect release of Waller on terms proposed by French
                    Government, making necessary exchange of notes. Cable when Waller is actually
                    released. If necessary, you can furnish him with transportation to the United
                    States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
